[I] Tools for managing the libosinfo database files

[T] osinfo-db-tools contains a set of tools such as osinfo-db-import,
[T] osinfo-db-export and osinfo-db-validate to help administrators and
[T] developers manage the libosinfo database. libosinfo provides information
[T] about operating systems, hypervisors and the virtual hardware they
[T] support.

[U] https://gitlab.com/libosinfo/osinfo-db-tools

[A] libosinfo
[M] andrei32

[C] extra/tool
[F] CROSS

[L] GPL
[V] 1.12.0

